1
00:00:00,873 --> 00:00:03,753
No one ever thinks it'll happen
until it does.

2
00:00:05,044 --> 00:00:09,884
(Leonard:)Penny, if you promise not to chew the flesh
off our bones while we sleep, you can stay.

3
00:00:10,341 --> 00:00:15,181
- Ha. What?
- He's engaging in reductio ad absurdum.

4
00:00:16,013 --> 00:00:19,603
It's the fallacy of extending someone's
argument to ridiculous proportions...

5
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:22,857
...and then criticizing the result.
And I don't appreciate it.

6
00:00:23,729 --> 00:00:26,109
(Leonard:)I'll get you a blanket and a pillow.

7
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:30,739
Okay, since I'm obviously being ignored
here, let's go over the morning schedule.

8
00:00:30,903 --> 00:00:33,443
I use the bathroom from 7 to 7:20.

9
00:00:33,614 --> 00:00:36,074
Plan your ablutions
and bodily functions accordingly.

10
00:00:37,577 --> 00:00:39,867
(Penny:)How am I supposed to
plan my bodily functions?

11
00:00:40,037 --> 00:00:42,287
(Sheldon:)I suggest no liquids after 11p.m.

12
00:00:43,249 --> 00:00:45,959
- Here you go.
- Thanks, Leonard.

13
00:00:47,003 --> 00:00:49,083
Heh, wrong.

14
00:00:51,924 --> 00:00:52,964
(Penny:)I'm listening.

15
00:00:53,134 --> 00:00:55,094
(Sheldon:)Your head goes on the other end.

16
00:00:55,261 --> 00:00:57,261
- Why?
- It's culturally universal.

17
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:59,220
(Sheldon:)A bed, even a temporary bed...

18
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:02,140
(Sheldon:)...is always oriented with the headboard
away from the door.

